edge function: a code that is written and attached to cloudfront distribution. To minimize latency.
two types: cloudfront functions&lambda@edge
SEO/Search engine optimization
cloudfront functions:
  1) written in javascript
  2) CDN customizations
  3) milions of requests/second
  4) change viewer
    4.1) viewer request
    4.2) viewer response
lambda@edge:
  1) written in nodejs or python
  2)response:
    2.1) viewer request: after cloudfront receives a request from a viewer
    2.2) origin request: before cloudfront forwards the request to the origin
    2.3) origin response: after cloudfront receives the response from the origin
    2.4) viewer response: before cloudfront forwards the response to the viewer
cloudfront is used for: cache key normalization, header manipulation, url rewrites or redirects, request authentication&authorization
lambda@edge:adjustable cpu or memory, code depends on a 3rd libraries, network access to use external services for processing, file system access or access to the body of http requests
